<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts trading moderate, $1.00 to $1.50 lower. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs     53.00-53.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs     52.50-53.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs     51.50-52.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs     50.50-51.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.50 lower. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-400 lbs     44.50</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs     46.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs     52.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs     54.00-55.00</p>
</text>
